@startuml
title T&T COMPUTER - Phụ thuộc nghiệp vụ
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
left to right direction
class CheckoutController
class Cart
class Account
class DeliveryAddress
class Promotion
class Order
class PaymentController
class SePayPayment
class OrderManagementController
class InventoryController
class Product
class Inventory
class StatisticsController
class Statistics
CheckoutController ..> Cart : loads cart
CheckoutController ..> Account : profile
CheckoutController ..> DeliveryAddress : address selection
CheckoutController ..> Promotion : voucher preview
CheckoutController ..> Order : placeOrder
CheckoutController ..> SePayPayment : configuration check
PaymentController ..> Order : lookup / IPN result
PaymentController ..> SePayPayment : build / verify
OrderManagementController ..> Order : status / return
InventoryController ..> Inventory : adjustment / history
Product ..> Promotion : effective price
StatisticsController ..> Statistics : period query
note bottom: Dependency là class được gọi trong code, không ngụ ý aggregation/composition.
@enduml
